verse = \lyricmode {
  I sought the \markup { \smallCaps "Lord" } in prayer;
he heard my plea and ans -- wered me.
From all my wor -- ries and my fears
the \markup { \smallCaps "Lord" } has set me free.
Those who on him re -- ly
will nev -- er hang their heads in shame.
When this poor man cried out for help,
the \markup { \smallCaps "Lord" } de -- liv -- ered him.
}
